  "releaseNotes": "0.3.4: MT5 chart and tick history over REST (ChartRequestAsync, TicksHistoryAsync); live MT5 ticks on the v2 hub (OnTick, StreamTicks, SubscribeToTicks, UnsubscribeFromTicks); batched ticks on the MT4 and MT5 v2 hubs (OnTicksBatch, SubscribeToTicksBatch, UnsubscribeFromTicksBatch); specification refreshed — 174 operations. Full notes: https://github.com/CPlugin/mywebapi.com-sdk-dotnet/blob/v0.3.4/CHANGELOG.md",
